
[TestNoAsyncStaticMethod/invalid-0 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: asyncStaticMethod (1:11 - 1:46)
Message: An async `static` method has no `this`, so the promises it awaits cannot be tracked.
Help: Drop `static` and make it an instance method, so every promise inside it can go through `this.track(...)` and be drained by `close()`.
   1 | class A { static async run(): Promise<void> {} }
     |           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
